IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g8-nouns`
IMPORT `g8-penalties`
IMPORT `g8-art29-31-information`
IMPORT `g8-tests-fixtures`

-- g8-tests-art29-31: tests of Articles 29 to 31.  Expected values were decided from the text of the Law before the module was run.
-- Each limb of 29(1) and each route of receipt, each case of 29(2), every consent combination on both readings of F8.11, the Article 30 duties, each of the six limbs of
-- Article 31 and a near-miss for each, and the interplay of 29(1) with 30 and 31.

§ `Tests of Articles 29 to 31`

§§ `Fixtures`

-- How the information was received.
`T29 information received under the Law` MEANS
    `Information received and its character` WITH
        `relates to the business or other affairs of a person` IS TRUE
        `received under or for the purposes of this Law` IS TRUE
        `received directly or indirectly from a person who so received it` IS FALSE
        `already made available to the public from other sources` IS FALSE
        `in the form of a summary or collection that identifies no particular person` IS FALSE

`T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` MEANS
    `Information received and its character` WITH
        `relates to the business or other affairs of a person` IS TRUE
        `received under or for the purposes of this Law` IS FALSE
        `received directly or indirectly from a person who so received it` IS TRUE
        `already made available to the public from other sources` IS FALSE
        `in the form of a summary or collection that identifies no particular person` IS FALSE

`T29 information received both ways` MEANS
    `Information received and its character` WITH
        `relates to the business or other affairs of a person` IS TRUE
        `received under or for the purposes of this Law` IS TRUE
        `received directly or indirectly from a person who so received it` IS TRUE
        `already made available to the public from other sources` IS FALSE
        `in the form of a summary or collection that identifies no particular person` IS FALSE

`T29 information that relates to no one's affairs` MEANS
    `Information received and its character` WITH
        `relates to the business or other affairs of a person` IS FALSE
        `received under or for the purposes of this Law` IS TRUE
        `received directly or indirectly from a person who so received it` IS FALSE
        `already made available to the public from other sources` IS FALSE
        `in the form of a summary or collection that identifies no particular person` IS FALSE

`T29 information received neither way` MEANS
    `Information received and its character` WITH
        `relates to the business or other affairs of a person` IS TRUE
        `received under or for the purposes of this Law` IS FALSE
        `received directly or indirectly from a person who so received it` IS FALSE
        `already made available to the public from other sources` IS FALSE
        `in the form of a summary or collection that identifies no particular person` IS FALSE

`T29 information already available to the public from other sources` MEANS
    `Information received and its character` WITH
        `relates to the business or other affairs of a person` IS TRUE
        `received under or for the purposes of this Law` IS TRUE
        `received directly or indirectly from a person who so received it` IS FALSE
        `already made available to the public from other sources` IS TRUE
        `in the form of a summary or collection that identifies no particular person` IS FALSE

`T29 a summary that identifies no particular person` MEANS
    `Information received and its character` WITH
        `relates to the business or other affairs of a person` IS TRUE
        `received under or for the purposes of this Law` IS TRUE
        `received directly or indirectly from a person who so received it` IS FALSE
        `already made available to the public from other sources` IS FALSE
        `in the form of a summary or collection that identifies no particular person` IS TRUE

-- A disclosure by a private person, to another private person, for no named purpose, with the consents stated.
`T29 a disclosure with no consent` MEANS
    `Disclosure of information` WITH
        `by or on behalf of the Commissioner` IS FALSE
        `recipient` IS `a disclosure to any other person`
        `to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function` IS FALSE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function` IS FALSE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function in relation to charities` IS FALSE
        `for the investigation or prosecution of an offence` IS FALSE
        `for taking or deciding whether to take proceedings under this Law` IS FALSE
        `in circumstances prescribed by Regulations` IS FALSE
        `required by the recipient for its functions` IS FALSE
        `consent of the person to whom the information relates` IS FALSE
        `consent of the person from whom the information was received` IS FALSE

`T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to` MEANS
    `Disclosure of information` WITH
        `by or on behalf of the Commissioner` IS FALSE
        `recipient` IS `a disclosure to any other person`
        `to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function` IS FALSE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function` IS FALSE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function in relation to charities` IS FALSE
        `for the investigation or prosecution of an offence` IS FALSE
        `for taking or deciding whether to take proceedings under this Law` IS FALSE
        `in circumstances prescribed by Regulations` IS FALSE
        `required by the recipient for its functions` IS FALSE
        `consent of the person to whom the information relates` IS TRUE
        `consent of the person from whom the information was received` IS FALSE

`T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it was received from` MEANS
    `Disclosure of information` WITH
        `by or on behalf of the Commissioner` IS FALSE
        `recipient` IS `a disclosure to any other person`
        `to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function` IS FALSE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function` IS FALSE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function in relation to charities` IS FALSE
        `for the investigation or prosecution of an offence` IS FALSE
        `for taking or deciding whether to take proceedings under this Law` IS FALSE
        `in circumstances prescribed by Regulations` IS FALSE
        `required by the recipient for its functions` IS FALSE
        `consent of the person to whom the information relates` IS FALSE
        `consent of the person from whom the information was received` IS TRUE

`T29 a disclosure with both consents` MEANS
    `Disclosure of information` WITH
        `by or on behalf of the Commissioner` IS FALSE
        `recipient` IS `a disclosure to any other person`
        `to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function` IS FALSE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function` IS FALSE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function in relation to charities` IS FALSE
        `for the investigation or prosecution of an offence` IS FALSE
        `for taking or deciding whether to take proceedings under this Law` IS FALSE
        `in circumstances prescribed by Regulations` IS FALSE
        `required by the recipient for its functions` IS FALSE
        `consent of the person to whom the information relates` IS TRUE
        `consent of the person from whom the information was received` IS TRUE

