-- Two limbs at once: by the Commissioner, to the Comptroller, for both purposes.
`T31 a disclosure by the Commissioner to the Comptroller for both purposes` MEANS
    `Disclosure of information` WITH
        `by or on behalf of the Commissioner` IS TRUE
        `recipient` IS `a disclosure to the Comptroller`
        `to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function` IS TRUE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function` IS TRUE
        `to enable the recipient to discharge a function in relation to charities` IS FALSE
        `for the investigation or prosecution of an offence` IS FALSE
