§§ `31 -- permitted disclosure`

#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure by the Commissioner to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function` EQUALS LIST `Article 31(a)`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure to the Comptroller to enable the Comptroller to discharge a function` EQUALS LIST `Article 31(b)`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure to the JFSC to enable it to discharge a function` EQUALS LIST `Article 31(c)`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure to the Attorney General for a function in relation to charities` EQUALS LIST `Article 31(d)`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure to any person for the investigation of an offence` EQUALS LIST `Article 31(e)`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure to any person for taking proceedings under the Law` EQUALS LIST `Article 31(e)`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure in circumstances prescribed by Regulations` EQUALS LIST `Article 31(f)`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure by the Commissioner to the Comptroller for both purposes` EQUALS LIST `Article 31(a)`, `Article 31(b)`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure to a stranger to enable the stranger to discharge a function` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure to the Attorney General for a function not in relation to charities` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T31 a disclosure to the Comptroller for no function` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `Art 31 the provisions that permit the disclosure` `T29 a disclosure with both consents` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `Art 31 the disclosure is permitted` `T31 a disclosure by the Commissioner to the Comptroller for both purposes`
#ASSERT `Art 31 the disclosure is permitted` `T31 a disclosure to the JFSC to enable it to discharge a function`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 31 the disclosure is permitted` `T31 a disclosure to a stranger to enable the stranger to discharge a function`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 31 the disclosure is permitted` `T29 a disclosure with both consents`
-- The limbs one by one.
#ASSERT `Art 31(a) by or on behalf of the Commissioner, to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function` `T31 a disclosure by the Commissioner to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 31(a) by or on behalf of the Commissioner, to enable the Commissioner to discharge a function` `T31 a disclosure to the Comptroller to enable the Comptroller to discharge a function`
#ASSERT `Art 31(b) to the Comptroller, to enable the Comptroller to discharge a function` `T31 a disclosure to the Comptroller to enable the Comptroller to discharge a function`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 31(b) to the Comptroller, to enable the Comptroller to discharge a function` `T31 a disclosure to the JFSC to enable it to discharge a function`
#ASSERT `Art 31(c) to the JFSC, to enable it to discharge a function` `T31 a disclosure to the JFSC to enable it to discharge a function`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 31(c) to the JFSC, to enable it to discharge a function` `T31 a disclosure to the Comptroller to enable the Comptroller to discharge a function`
#ASSERT `Art 31(d) to the Attorney General, the Bailiff or the court, to enable them to discharge a function in relation to charities` `T31 a disclosure to the Attorney General for a function in relation to charities`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 31(d) to the Attorney General, the Bailiff or the court, to enable them to discharge a function in relation to charities` `T31 a disclosure to the Attorney General for a function not in relation to charities`
#ASSERT `Art 31(e) to any person, for the investigation or prosecution of an offence or for taking or deciding whether to take proceedings under this Law` `T31 a disclosure to any person for taking proceedings under the Law`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 31(e) to any person, for the investigation or prosecution of an offence or for taking or deciding whether to take proceedings under this Law` `T31 a disclosure to a stranger to enable the stranger to discharge a function`
#ASSERT `Art 31(f) in other circumstances prescribed by the States by Regulations` `T31 a disclosure in circumstances prescribed by Regulations`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 31(f) in other circumstances prescribed by the States by Regulations` `T29 a disclosure with both consents`

-- The States' power to prescribe more circumstances.
