§ `Tests of the private readings of Article 29(1), called directly`

-- Reading A (both consents), by how the information was received.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) reading A: both consents given` `T29 information received under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with no consent`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) reading A: both consents given` `T29 information received under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) reading A: both consents given` `T29 information received under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with both consents`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) reading A: both consents given` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) reading A: both consents given` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it was received from`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) reading A: both consents given` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with both consents`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) reading A: both consents given` `T29 information received both ways` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to`
-- Reading B (either consent).
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) reading B: either consent given` `T29 information received under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with no consent`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) reading B: either consent given` `T29 information received under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) reading B: either consent given` `T29 information received under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it was received from`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) reading B: either consent given` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) reading B: either consent given` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it was received from`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) reading B: either consent given` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with no consent`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) reading B: either consent given` `T29 information received both ways` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to`
-- The reading chosen by the record.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) the disclosure has the consent Article 29(1) requires` `the favoured interpretation` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) the disclosure has the consent Article 29(1) requires` `the interpretation with the other reading of F8.11` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with the consent of the person it relates to`
#ASSERT `Art 29(1) the disclosure has the consent Article 29(1) requires` `the favoured interpretation` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with both consents`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 29(1) the disclosure has the consent Article 29(1) requires` `the interpretation with the other reading of F8.11` `T29 information received from a person who received it under the Law` `T29 a disclosure with no consent`

